# Canonical JSON contracts and pinned provider files are compared byte-exactly
# (canonicalJson + "\n" for manifests; sha256 for analyze.py / model blobs), so
# they must check out with LF endings on every platform. Windows runners default
# to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites LF blobs to CRLF in the working tree and
# breaks those byte-exact checks (EXPLORATION_VISION_BUNDLE_MANIFEST_NONCANONICAL).
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf